comments.body:
@benaadams we're well past the deadline for CFI'ing EIPs for Fusaka so unless there's an overwhelming amount of community support, full test coverage, and strong client consensus for EIP-7939, then I don't think we should re-open the Fusaka CFI conversation. That said, thank you for sharing your SFI preferences, we'll hopefully finalize those on the call. 

@alonmuroch queued you up for right after the Fusaka planning conversation 😄 

@abcoathup thanks for putting this together! I think we should touch on it as part of the. Glamsterdam planning convo if time permits. As a side note, I wonder if we should improve the `/pm` repo to be clearer about all this info. 

@simsonraj added it to the agenda if time permits at the end. If you have specific questions or input you'd like from client teams, I'd suggest giving more context in your comment.
